<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>SAFEPATH - Smart Routes. Safer Journeys.</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <style>
    body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:0; background:#ffffff; color:#333; }
    header { background:url('cityscape.jpg') center/cover no-repeat; padding:80px 20px; text-align:center; position:relative; color:#004080; }
    header img { height:100px; position:absolute; top:20px; left:20px; }
    header h1 { font-size:3em; margin:0; }
    header p { font-size:1.2em; }
    nav { background:#004080; padding:10px; text-align:center; }
    nav a { color:#fff; margin:0 15px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:bold; }
    section { padding:40px; max-width:900px; margin:auto; opacity:0; transform:translateY(30px); transition:all 1s ease; }
    section.visible { opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }
    h2 { color:#004080; }
    .features { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; }
    .feature { flex:1; min-width:200px; background:#f9f9f9; padding:20px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #004080; }
    footer { background:#004080; color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:20px; margin-top:40px; }
    button { background:#004080; color:#fff; padding:12px 25px; border:none; border-radius:8px; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; }
    button:hover { background:#0066cc; }
    form { background:#f9f9f9; padding:20px; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #ccc; }
    input, textarea { width:100%; padding:10px; margin:10px 0; border:1px solid #ccc; border-radius:5px; }
    input[type="submit"] { background:#004080; color:#fff; font-weight:bold; cursor:pointer; }
    input[type="submit"]:hover { background:#0066cc; }

    /* Map + route styles */
    .map-container {
      position: relative;
      height: 400px;
      background: url('map-vizag.jpg') center/cover no-repeat;
      border: 2px solid #004080;
      margin: 20px auto;
      border-radius: 10px;
      max-width: 900px;
    }
    .route {
      position: absolute;
      height: 4px;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }
    .route.green { background-color: green; top: 150px; left: 60px; width: 200px; }
    .route.blue { background-color: blue; top: 180px; left: 80px; width: 180px; }
    .route.red { background-color: red; top: 210px; left: 100px; width: 160px; }
    .info {
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 20px auto;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      max-width: 900px;
    }
    .route-details {
      margin: 10px 0;
      padding: 10px;
      border-left: 5px solid #004080;
      background-color: #fff;
    }
    .recommended {
      background-color: #e6ffe6;
      border-left-color: green;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <img src="912Ae1MHFLaEZ9Dx8US9v.png" alt="SAFEPATH Logo">
  <h1>🛡️ SAFEPATH</h1>
  <p>Smart Routes. Safer Journeys.</p>
  <button>Try Prototype</button>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#features">Features</a>
  <a href="#map">Map</a>
  <a href="#edge">Competitive Edge</a>
  <a href="#cta">Join Us</a>
</nav>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About SAFEPATH</h2>
  <p>Unsafe journeys and lack of real-time safety data are major challenges. SAFEPATH solves this with AI-powered navigation, community insights, and municipal partnerships.</p>
</section>

<section id="features">
  <h2>Features</h2>
  <div class="features">
    <div class="feature">🚨 Real-time incident alerts</div>
    <div class="feature">🤖 AI risk scoring for routes</div>
    <div class="feature">🌍 Crowdsourced local insights</div>
    <div class="feature">📶 Offline accessibility</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="map">
  <h2>Live Route Preview</h2>
  <div class="map-container">
    <div class="route green"></div>
    <div class="route blue"></div>
    <div class="route red"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="info">
    <h3>Route Analysis</h3>
    <div class="route-details recommended">
      <strong>Route 1 (Recommended)</strong><br>
      Distance: 5.2 km | Time: 12 mins | Safety Score: 96/100
    </div>
    <div class="route-details">
      <strong>Route 2</strong><br>
      Distance: 4.8 km | Time: 14 mins | Safety Score: 72/100
    </div>
    <div class="route-details">
      <strong>Route 3</strong><br>
      Distance: 6.1 km | Time: 16 mins | Safety Score: 32/100
    </div>
    <p><strong>Recommended Route:</strong> Take Route 1 for a safer journey!</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="edge">
  <h2>Competitive Edge</h2>
  <p>Unlike Life360, Waze, MapmyIndia, and SafeTrek, SAFEPATH integrates all missing features into one ecosystem.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Life360 → Family safety only → SAFEPATH adds navigation + AI risk scoring</li>
    <li>Waze → Traffic hazards only → SAFEPATH adds real-time incident alerts</li>
    <li>MapmyIndia → India-focused navigation → SAFEPATH adds global + municipal partnerships</li>
    <li>SafeTrek → SOS dispatch only → SAFEPATH adds community insights + offline access</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="cta">
  <h2>Join Us on the Journey to Safer Cities!</h2>
  <button>Innovate with Us 💡</button>
  <button>Partner 🤝</button>
  <button>Invest 📈</button>
  
  <form>
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <input type="text" placeholder="Your Name" required>
    <input type="email" placeholder="Your Email" required>
    <textarea placeholder="Your Message" rows="5" required></textarea>
    <input type="submit" value="Send Message">
  </form>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2026 SAFEPATH. All rights reserved.</p>
</footer>

<script>
  // Smooth scroll
  document.querySelectorAll('nav a').forEach(anchor => {
    anchor.addEventListener('click', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      document.querySelector(this.getAttribute('href')).scrollIntoView({
        behavior: 'smooth'
      });
    });
  });

  // Fade-in sections
  const sections = document.querySelectorAll("section");
  window.addEventListener("scroll", () => {
    sections.forEach(sec => {
      const rect = sec.getBoundingClientRect();
      if(rect.top < window.innerHeight - 100) {
        sec.classList.add("visible");
      }
    });
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>